Welcome to rv32i-linux (rv32imac, Sv32)

Tools:
  nano            text editor
  mc              midnight commander
  links           text web browser
  python3         Python interpreter

Fun commands:
  sl              steam locomotive
  ascii_invaders  ASCII space invaders
  bvi             vi-like hex editor
  bc              arbitrary-precision calculator
  mawk            AWK interpreter

Type 'busybox --list' for all applets.
